OL,3,AA glimmer of good news for Britain's
OL,4,Asleepy dormouse
OL,5,
OL,6,FDormouse numbers may be recovering in
OL,7,FEngland and Wales after years of
OL,8,Fdecline, offering a rare piece of good
OL,9,Fnews for one of our best-loved mammals.
OL,11,FThe animal has disappeared from much of
OL,12,Fthe countryside with conservationists
OL,13,Fwarning of a long-term collapse in its
OL,14,Fpopulation.
OL,16,FHowever, new data suggests dormouse
OL,17,Fnumbers increased between 2020-2025, a
OL,18,Fperiod that coincided with warmer
OL,19,Fsprings and summers.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
